  _description: "Down at the dragon skeleton, I can find mushrooms of the fire variety.
    After long research, it turns out mushrooms from the cave aren\u2019t toxic,
    and are safe for consumption. Fortunately I kept reading, because they\u2019re
    so spicy, they\u2019ll make you wish for death."
